     The Backrooms was found and discovered accidently during the internet video sharing silver age. Upon this discovery prompted alphabet companies to purchase the video sharing sites and eventually, Devs pixelated the Backrooms.

     Taking the physical backroom space to build up the largest server guild to have ever existed which forms the digitalized backrooms konwn as "Pixeled Backrooms". All the servers taking up this space between space causes photon entanglement which allows the light passing through the physical backrooms to be entangled with the Pixeled Backrooms. End up in the phyical space of the backrooms, Appear also in the Pixeled Backrooms.

     The absolute entanglement of the digital-to-phyical space creates a huge disruption in the original timeline so when the wiesal timeline catalyst happened, randomly blackholes collapse under this disrupted wieght of the universe's surface tension being too tight. When a blackhole collapses, a whitestar exploades; this causes two points to entangle that should never entangle-- Pixeled Backrooms digital space to natural space instead of only in-between natural space.

     Areas of the real physical world get sucked into the Pixeled Backrooms but that means there are ways to escape and return by being in an anomly when it happens. But, that also means the creatures of the backrooms can go into reality like never before.
